{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1000_null", "source_sha256": "cf99cd80fe9242c0a27ca77dd4802d66caaf972dffc7baca88947b08df7eefc2", "ja": "Team5th出演『地元からオハヨー！』\n生放送ライブ終了後……", "zh": "Team5th出演的《来自当地的早安！》\n现场直播演出结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "94371a19f38fd0c7fcb029d30994aab0a7c4785dab7a944a749deae2e8797590", "ja": "あ、プロデューサー！\nよかった、探してたんです。", "zh": "啊，制作人！\n太好了，我正找你呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "139a8b3837f558f61a511f0e6f00b0f224398312f2536226ee34474da544df21", "ja": "紗代子、お疲れさま。\nどうかしたのか？", "zh": "紗代子，辛苦了。是怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "19b970a5b5999eb2e1234b865dd793503a6746c80b6230d8cb468c21ac0f73ba", "ja": "いえ、あの、ステージが無事に終わったので……\nプロデューサーにお礼を言いたくて。", "zh": "没有，那个，舞台演出顺利结束了……\n所以想向制作人道个谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "b04aed35b13ac2f90cc1afcb5751bea66a3c3b43b4e50ad21f7fdeed32606dae", "ja": "今回のお仕事も生放送ライブも、最後までやりきる\nことができました。ありがとうございました！", "zh": "这次的工作和现场直播，也都顺利坚持到了最后。谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1005_401pro", "source_sha256": "5fe288a4b8fb850c91f8fc518cf75058e6dd6b73dbcd61416d6f8aa91015e510", "ja": "お礼なんて……。紗代子達のパフォーマンスは、\n全部紗代子達の頑張りの成果だよ。", "zh": "不用道谢……紗代子她们的表演，全部都是她们努力的成果啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1006_401pro", "source_sha256": "fb93b7a84b64caef1ca6a51adaebef092776f40ff3fc178f0ce62aebd1f73b70", "ja": "みんなが担当したコーナーの反応も上々だし、\nステージも、SNSで結構話題になってるぞ。", "zh": "大家负责的环节反响也很好，舞台表演在SNS上也相当引人热议呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "60139cb4b628742387a3b72cccd8a021eca0077604015bd5d7fb5905209bab64", "ja": "あ、そっか！　生放送だから、すぐ感想が見られるん\nですね。えっと……あっ、ホントだ！", "zh": "啊，对哦！因为是直播，所以马上就能看到感想\n了。呃……啊，真的耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "d27e478608711e6b84e8e960cea32e885fc74e073be2449a644e671c081f0f75", "ja": "「朝にぴったりのいい曲！」「元気もらえた！」\n……よかった。届いてたんだ……！", "zh": "“非常适合早上的好歌！”“让我打起精神了！”\n……太好了。有传达到大家心里啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1010_401pro", "source_sha256": "9f47123e6023bf543dfeab805c609b375df7657c02158d5ea7498a6e9367f7f2", "ja": "？　紗代子？", "zh": "咦，纱代子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "f7be4a200c756034d59ae54455d9cd9bbbbd8c1bae201cfefc628a34aa2a0022", "ja": "その……生放送ライブ、今やれること、\n精一杯やりきれたと思います。", "zh": "那个……这场直播演唱会，我想我们已经尽全力完成了现在能做到的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "216cf1889ebfcb1c04099476225de98c899a6a1868366e95fc74d40e577dd73f", "ja": "でも、まだまだ未熟なところがあることは、私も……\n私達も、よく分かっていて……。", "zh": "可是，我们也很清楚，自己还有许多不成熟的地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1013_401pro", "source_sha256": "badaff19d7f175c7fe3045be37aae2569ce111b705a2b17f51a0642fe6fee940", "ja": "あ、そうか……。うん、SNSだと、\n厳しい感想も遠慮なく書かれてるよな。", "zh": "啊，这样啊……嗯，在SNS上，\n大家也会毫不客气地写下严厉的评价。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1014_401pro", "source_sha256": "f13e74ea2672d59656830c5069c4b481849cd797e042ecdd32ced98c13b3162d", "ja": "えっと……、「フリが揃ってない」とか、\n「センターの子、テンパってる」とか……", "zh": "那个……比如“动作没对齐”，或者“站在中间的那个孩子慌了”之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "2d2093e3a10496a1130ab4011ac85c95eae0720791b15e8ed933344d0c8991d7", "ja": "う……。", "zh": "呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "e71af3fde08b66efbbc9cc3019861823da68ed538834fd47a5e5e2b6b21d7dcb", "ja": "「でも、そこがいい」とかな！", "zh": "“不过，这也正是魅力所在”之类的吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "3860469828b3cc6976c2ecbca46da8aa5344443ea4b1fe968039f3412d0afea6", "ja": "テレビの前には、本当にいろんな人がいる。\n全員に喜んでもらうのは、なかなか難しいと思う。", "zh": "电视机前真的有形形色色的人。\n我觉得要让所有人都感到开心，确实很难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "d0cdfeef45f772f1837c07066e891eea2029b841d7f1d3156d28b4ab9b253e4b", "ja": "でもやり切ったからこそ、たくさんの人に見てもらえて\nたくさんの元気も届けられたんじゃないかな。", "zh": "正因为坚持完成了，才能让很多人看到，也才能把满满的活力传递给大家吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "031bd468386d7c060dcaf05ebf8f88ac539e6881ae3d6c7db579040bcd1bf246", "ja": "……そうですよね。やり切れなかったら誰にも、\n何も届けられませんでした。", "zh": "……是啊。如果没能坚持做到底的话，\n就什么都传达不给任何人了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "edee64eeeecca3e24928d815c3b6d3989359a6ddd427f08ba3b9ae75d80139f6", "ja": "でも、勇気を出してやり切ったからこそ、\n私達、たくさんの人に……出会えたんですね！", "zh": "但是，正因为鼓起勇气坚持到底，我们才能和这么多人……相遇呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1022_401pro", "source_sha256": "3560afc32f946537bcd13b22cbec6660ea4b0da69e042a00fa84231d2c4a6f1e", "ja": "ああ、これからも何度でもチャンスはある。\nどんどん、やり切っていこう！", "zh": "啊，今后还会有很多次机会。\n我们就继续一次次全力以赴吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1023_027say", "source_sha256": "0e9527b1a4efa4402a6354021e26d3bcb7a71882dff15fe255a860cbe1288b99", "ja": "はい！　プロデューサー、早速ですけど今日、\n劇場に戻ったらレッスンルーム、使わせてください！", "zh": "好的！制作人，虽然有点突然，不过今天回剧场后，请让我使用练习室！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1024_401pro", "source_sha256": "951aa84cf5577cd0b6d0cc3762d3cb5b5185cbe999b099f50798576921697a9a", "ja": "えっ！？　い、いいけど……、さすがに今日は\n仕事の後だし、休んだほうがよくないかな？", "zh": "诶！？ 可、可以是可以……不过，今天毕竟是工作结束后，还是休息一下比较好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1025_027say", "source_sha256": "3899712608c96ffc3aa4f4bd2f1a01f72a8f4b95d08867d4362f6343f486d207", "ja": "いいえ！　今、いてもたってもいられないんです。\n次はもっと成長した姿を届けたくて！", "zh": "不行！我现在根本坐立难安。\n我想下次展现出更加成长的模样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0443_1026_027say", "source_sha256": "32eb057cbf008629cbbfa6a8c5f69b8a8719bc2de86e43412175e025de837e93", "ja": "それに、頑張ることが、私の取り柄ですから。\nこれからも、全力で頑張りますね！！", "zh": "而且，努力正是我的长处。\n今后我也会全力以赴的！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
